# Rename Element… from the text (the element named at the cursor) and from the canvas (the one
# selected): its id and every reference to it change, comments and layout stay.
caret 6 4
rename-at buyer
caret 6 15
rename-at store
undo
select db
rename-selected orders
rename-selected 9bad
rename-selected shop
caret 2 1
rename-at nothing
